 om/course/courseoverview?P=5&EID=60504\n\nOverviewPrimary care providers a
 re often the first healthcare professionals to evaluate patients with conc
 erns about heavy menstrual bleeding. This webinar will explore the causes 
 of heavy menstrual bleeding\, including underlying bleeding disorders such
  as hemophilia and von Willebrand disease. Participants will review common
  treatment approaches for managing heavy menstrual bleeding and associated
  symptoms\, including hormonal therapies\, factor and non-factor therapies
 \, tranexamic acid\, aminocaproic acid\, and iron supplementation. The web
 inar will also provide practical guidance to support the ongoing managemen
 t of patients with heavy menstrual bleeding\, including recognizing when s
 pecialty care is warranted.\n\nRegistrationRegistration for all practition
